            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='8'>Calculate Country Adoption Rate = Spend Actual in the adopted Sub-Channels divided by total Spend Actual. If there was a tie in the Stage 1, we choose optimisation run with higher Adoption Rate</run>
